WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:51.324 --> 00:01:56.159
Tenchi, thanks for today.
I had a really great time.

00:01:57.264 --> 00:01:59.433
I've made up my mind.

00:01:59.433 --> 00:02:04.704
I'm gonna stop moping around just
because I don't remember anything.

00:02:04.704 --> 00:02:08.708
I mean, I can start making memories now.

00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:11.643
I can make them together with you, Tenchi.

00:02:12.312 --> 00:02:15.682
Sports Day this fall, Christmas
Eve with just the two of us...

00:02:15.682 --> 00:02:18.385
Oh, right! And going to
the temple on New Year's Day!

00:02:18.385 --> 00:02:24.984
I'm here to love you.
That's the feeling I get, somehow.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:32.456
Tenchi, I fell more and more in love with you.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:42.574
Ryo-Ohki!

00:02:43.243 --> 00:02:45.879
Be strong, Princess!

00:02:45.879 --> 00:02:50.475
Oh, dear. I said someone
would get hurt, didn't I?

00:02:51.284 --> 00:02:56.056
This is Lord Tenchi's...
This is my and Lord Tenchi's home!

00:02:56.056 --> 00:02:59.583
I won't let the likes of
you lay one finger on it!

00:03:00.794 --> 00:03:03.456
We'll just see about that, won't we?

00:03:12.672 --> 00:03:16.343
I won't lose! I won't be beaten!

00:03:16.343 --> 00:03:18.243
Lord Tenchi!

00:03:25.352 --> 00:03:28.253
Lord... Tenchi...

00:03:30.824 --> 00:03:33.894
S-Sister!

00:03:33.894 --> 00:03:37.557
Reality certainly is tough, isn't it?

00:03:38.465 --> 00:03:39.955
You...

00:03:56.416 --> 00:03:59.408
Tell Grandfather and Washu!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.878
Sasami's been kidnapped?!
And Ayeka's been badly hurt?!

00:04:04.724 --> 00:04:11.665
What? They went after Sasami,
not Tenchi, the Defender heir?!

00:04:11.665 --> 00:04:15.032
Ayeka... Sasami...

00:04:18.471 --> 00:04:20.439
Sasami...

00:04:21.975 --> 00:04:24.911
With you here, Sasami,
I don't need anything else.

00:04:24.911 --> 00:04:29.939
I don't need people or cities
or oceans or the sky or the stars.

00:04:30.917 --> 00:04:38.824
Come, let's make a
world for just the two of us.

00:05:15.629 --> 00:05:17.797
Wh-What in the world?

00:05:17.797 --> 00:05:20.800
Yugi's broken the dimension barrier.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.871
Time standing still is
something like a side effect.

00:05:24.871 --> 00:05:29.876
If it weren't for these gems'
power, we'd be out of action, too.

00:05:29.876 --> 00:05:32.140
Yugi...

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.182
Tenchi! Where are you going?

00:05:36.182 --> 00:05:39.486
You aren't going to where Yugi is, are you?

00:05:39.486 --> 00:05:43.556
This isn't someone you
can handle on your own.

00:05:43.556 --> 00:05:45.258
Rushing in is pointless.

00:05:45.258 --> 00:05:46.593
Please get out of the way.

00:05:46.593 --> 00:05:48.493
Tenchi!

00:05:51.097 --> 00:05:53.600
Don't you understand what's happening?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:57.771
A Defender mustn't be carried
away by a moment's emotion!

00:05:57.771 --> 00:06:01.708
Unless you gather together everyone's
gems, there's nothing you can do!

00:06:01.708 --> 00:06:03.573
Tenchi!

00:06:04.878 --> 00:06:06.812
Move!

00:06:08.314 --> 00:06:10.305
Tenchi!

00:06:21.394 --> 00:06:25.198
I'm sorry I stuck you in there.

00:06:25.198 --> 00:06:29.736
But this would be hard for you.

00:06:29.736 --> 00:06:33.506
You were the only one who
said you were my friend, Sasami.

00:06:33.506 --> 00:06:37.544
You were the only one who smiled at me.

00:06:37.544 --> 00:06:40.180
So I'll change this world.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.949
I'll change it into a
world for just you and me!

00:06:42.949 --> 00:06:49.445
And then you'll smile at
me again, won't you, Sasami?

00:06:52.892 --> 00:06:56.089
I ruined everything!

00:06:57.831 --> 00:06:59.560
I ruined it!

00:07:00.266 --> 00:07:03.803
I can't ask them! I can't ask them for help!

00:07:03.803 --> 00:07:09.642
I fell into Yugi's trap and split everyone up!

00:07:09.642 --> 00:07:15.815
I was a jerk who hurt Ayeka
and Sasami and everyone else!

00:07:15.815 --> 00:07:17.908
I can't ask them!

00:07:18.952 --> 00:07:20.920
Tenchi...

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.490
Yugi!

00:07:35.869 --> 00:07:37.928
There you are!

00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:43.736
Did I get him?

00:07:55.755 --> 00:07:57.882
You're mine!

00:08:10.036 --> 00:08:11.638
It's over!

00:08:11.638 --> 00:08:13.697
Oops!

00:08:14.207 --> 00:08:16.539
You two sure are trying hard.

00:08:21.781 --> 00:08:24.884
I'm kinda bored of this.

00:08:24.884 --> 00:08:26.647
Here!

00:08:44.237 --> 00:08:47.070
Sakuya...

00:08:50.443 --> 00:08:54.280
She was always near me.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.483
She laughed when she was with me.

00:08:57.483 --> 00:09:02.689
She wasn't an illusion or some reflection!

00:09:02.689 --> 00:09:05.959
She was always by my side...

00:09:05.959 --> 00:09:08.120
And you...

00:09:08.962 --> 00:09:11.264
You...

00:09:11.264 --> 00:09:13.232
You!

00:09:25.745 --> 00:09:27.940
How could you!

00:09:46.699 --> 00:09:48.633
Tenchi...

00:09:57.911 --> 00:10:02.148
Oh, dear. He doesn't know when to give up.

00:10:02.148 --> 00:10:05.385
Leave him be, Matori.

00:10:05.385 --> 00:10:08.718
This should prove to be interesting.

00:10:30.209 --> 00:10:32.111
Really?

00:10:32.111 --> 00:10:34.102
That's cool!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.849
You've gotta show me!

00:10:36.849 --> 00:10:38.618
Bring it with you!

00:10:38.618 --> 00:10:42.952
S-Sakuya?

00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:21.419
Sakuya?

00:11:22.228 --> 00:11:25.356
What's with the weird look on your face?

00:11:25.665 --> 00:11:30.136
S-Sakuya, you...

00:11:30.136 --> 00:11:34.232
Why are you acting like that, Tenchi Masaki?

00:11:35.074 --> 00:11:38.211
And after I went to all the
trouble of inviting you to my castle...

00:11:38.211 --> 00:11:40.079
Don't you like it?

00:11:40.079 --> 00:11:41.637
In that case...

00:11:46.319 --> 00:11:48.554
Why are you so surprised?

00:11:48.554 --> 00:11:52.792
This is my world. I can
change it any way I like.

00:11:52.792 --> 00:11:55.693
And my reflection, too, of course.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:59.089
Damn you!

00:11:59.966 --> 00:12:02.435
Tenchi?

00:12:02.435 --> 00:12:04.903
What's wrong? You look so scary.

00:12:09.776 --> 00:12:13.379
Go on, enjoy yourselves any way you like.

00:12:13.379 --> 00:12:18.451
This is what you and Sakuya wanted,
isn't it? A world for just you two?

00:12:18.451 --> 00:12:24.151
Or are you going to abandon her?
Abandon her to save this world?

00:12:32.198 --> 00:12:33.859
Wh-What?

00:12:43.876 --> 00:12:46.112
You still don't get it, do you?

00:12:46.112 --> 00:12:53.314
No matter what you do,
you can't break my heart!

00:12:55.755 --> 00:12:59.122
You're wrong about just one
thing, so I'll tell you what it is.

00:13:02.628 --> 00:13:05.898
It doesn't matter who's with Tenchi.

00:13:05.898 --> 00:13:08.025
The one who's gonna win in the end...

00:13:08.568 --> 00:13:10.866
...is me!

00:13:17.043 --> 00:13:22.482
What's the matter, you two?
It's not like you to play possum.

00:13:22.482 --> 00:13:25.246
There's only one thing left to try.

00:13:26.285 --> 00:13:28.454
Kiyone! That's a...

00:13:28.454 --> 00:13:30.523
An antimatter dimension bullet.

00:13:30.523 --> 00:13:32.625
But you can't use those
without getting authorization

00:13:32.625 --> 00:13:35.128
again and again from the top brass, right?

00:13:35.128 --> 00:13:38.531
This isn't the time to worry about that!

00:13:38.531 --> 00:13:39.899
Listen.

00:13:39.899 --> 00:13:43.936
I'll draw his fire, so you finish him off.

00:13:43.936 --> 00:13:45.870
Kiyone...

00:13:50.343 --> 00:13:53.938
Am I supposed to be afraid of that?

00:14:10.696 --> 00:14:12.721
Mihoshi?

00:14:13.799 --> 00:14:16.097
Y-You...

00:14:16.802 --> 00:14:19.862
Kiyone... look out...

00:14:34.353 --> 00:14:36.913
You people are the lowest of the low!

00:14:38.257 --> 00:14:39.781
Wh-What the...?

00:14:52.171 --> 00:14:55.608
Come on, Mihoshi.
Let's go back to where we belong.

00:14:55.608 --> 00:14:58.133
Ouch...

00:15:30.977 --> 00:15:33.913
That's right, Tenchi Masaki.

00:15:33.913 --> 00:15:41.513
Just give everything to me, and
you can be with Sakuya forever.

00:15:42.722 --> 00:15:46.317
I win, Sasami.

00:15:50.229 --> 00:15:52.064
It's so pretty!

00:15:52.064 --> 00:15:53.766
Yeah...

00:15:53.766 --> 00:15:58.871
Next year, I hope we can watch the
cherry blossoms together like this.

00:15:58.871 --> 00:16:00.573
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:00.573 --> 00:16:05.943
Let's have a cherry blossom party
next year! I'll make you a box lunch!

00:16:08.114 --> 00:16:10.014
And then let's...

00:16:13.552 --> 00:16:19.081
Sakuya... You said
you loved me, didn't you?

00:16:20.459 --> 00:16:24.418
I never gave you an answer, did I?

00:16:26.732 --> 00:16:29.326
I'm sorry I made you wait.

00:16:33.572 --> 00:16:38.805
I love you, too...

00:16:39.612 --> 00:16:41.807
Tenchi...

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:01.534
I'm so happy... I waited so long...

00:17:01.534 --> 00:17:05.197
But it's time.

00:17:06.339 --> 00:17:08.170
Sakuya...

00:17:08.708 --> 00:17:13.512
It doesn't matter.
It's a little frustrating, though.

00:17:13.512 --> 00:17:17.083
It's all right. It's enough.

00:17:17.083 --> 00:17:19.785
The time for dreaming is over.

00:17:19.785 --> 00:17:22.188
Enough! I'll erase you two!

00:17:22.188 --> 00:17:25.558
I'll erase the both of you!

00:17:25.558 --> 00:17:28.026
Sakuya, l...

00:17:28.361 --> 00:17:31.530
It's okay. I know.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:37.269
However pretty it is here,
however fun it is, this is just a dream.

00:17:37.269 --> 00:17:41.000
People can't live inside an illusion.

00:17:43.376 --> 00:17:48.414
You have things to do, Tenchi.
You have people waiting for you,

00:17:48.414 --> 00:17:51.951
and you have someplace
you have to go back to.

00:17:51.951 --> 00:17:54.353
Each second of the time I was with you,

00:17:54.353 --> 00:18:00.059
and each second of the time
I thought I'd get to spend with you...

00:18:00.059 --> 00:18:04.826
...is a precious treasure to me.

00:18:06.599 --> 00:18:09.864
All of my treasures...

00:18:11.704 --> 00:18:14.407
...are right in here.

00:18:14.407 --> 00:18:18.639
So it's okay. I won't be lonely anymore.

00:18:22.615 --> 00:18:24.947
Begone!

00:18:29.889 --> 00:18:33.959
I... I'd better get going, then.

00:18:33.959 --> 00:18:36.028
Right.

00:18:36.028 --> 00:18:37.996
Bye bye.

00:19:01.353 --> 00:19:03.048
Sasami?

00:19:22.675 --> 00:19:23.809
Hey.

00:19:23.809 --> 00:19:25.709
Ryoko?

00:19:29.315 --> 00:19:30.649
L-I...

00:19:30.649 --> 00:19:32.451
Oh, what're you looking so depressed for?

00:19:32.451 --> 00:19:36.088
Pull yourself together, okay? Pull it together!

00:19:36.088 --> 00:19:39.191
That's how things are with us! Don't sweat it!

00:19:39.191 --> 00:19:40.886
Ryoko...

00:19:57.776 --> 00:19:59.111
Ayeka!

00:19:59.111 --> 00:20:00.880
Are you all right, Lord Tenchi?

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.382
Nobody asked you to show up!

00:20:03.382 --> 00:20:08.287
- Get lost, you stupid princess! Shoo! Shoo!
- H-How dare you, you animal!

00:20:08.287 --> 00:20:10.789
You're a pox on this dimension!

00:20:10.789 --> 00:20:12.758
Say what?!

00:20:12.758 --> 00:20:14.919
Do you have a problem, you ape?

00:20:18.097 --> 00:20:20.565
It's not over yet!

00:20:26.138 --> 00:20:27.573
You hit her!

00:20:27.573 --> 00:20:29.375
That's a good thing, you idiot!

00:20:29.375 --> 00:20:31.309
Tenchi!

00:20:37.283 --> 00:20:39.518
S-Sasami!

00:20:39.518 --> 00:20:40.486
Sasami!

00:20:40.486 --> 00:20:41.253
Sister!

00:20:41.253 --> 00:20:42.655
Mihoshi? Kiyone?

00:20:42.655 --> 00:20:43.989
Mihoshi, your wounds!

00:20:43.989 --> 00:20:44.657
Huh?

00:20:44.657 --> 00:20:48.661
Guys... What're you guys doing here?
How did you guys get here?!

00:20:48.661 --> 00:20:51.530
This is the power of the gems.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.399
Washu...

00:20:53.399 --> 00:20:58.170
The truth is, we all
wanted to come back to you.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:03.335
But... But it was my fault
that everybody split up.

00:21:04.143 --> 00:21:06.008
Sasami...

00:21:08.914 --> 00:21:11.144
Sasami...

00:21:35.507 --> 00:21:39.111
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.111 --> 00:21:43.015
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.015 --> 00:21:46.619
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:46.619 --> 00:21:50.556
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:50.556 --> 00:21:54.059
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.059 --> 00:21:58.030
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:01.367
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.367 --> 00:22:05.371
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.371 --> 00:22:07.506
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:07.506 --> 00:22:09.441
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:09.441 --> 00:22:10.943
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:10.943 --> 00:22:16.782
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:16.782 --> 00:22:20.886
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:20.886 --> 00:22:24.156
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.156 --> 00:22:27.693
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:27.693 --> 00:22:32.392
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:42.041 --> 00:22:44.475
We sure have been through a lot, Tenchi...

00:22:45.177 --> 00:22:49.782
We really do have a
destiny that keeps us together!

00:22:49.782 --> 00:22:53.952
Okay! Let's get in there
and finish this, Tenchi!

00:22:53.952 --> 00:22:57.623
Let's pay her back with
interest for using us like puppets!

00:22:57.623 --> 00:23:01.760
Go, go, go, Tenchi!
That's the manly thing to do!

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:04.196
I've fallen in love all over again!

00:23:04.196 --> 00:23:10.032
Next time, on the final episode
of <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i> "Payback."
